    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Genererad berättande text: CapabilityStatement IneraIndexServer</b></p><a name=\"IneraIndexServer\"> </a><a name=\"hcIneraIndexServer\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">FHIR-EI server</h2><ul><li>Implementationsguidens version: 0.1.0 </li><li>FHIR-version: 5.0.0 </li><li>Format som stöds: <code>json</code>, <code>xml</code></li><li>Publicerad: 2026-10-26 </li><li>Publicerad av: Inera AB </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Notera till implementörer: FHIR-förmågor</strong></p><p>Vilken FHIR-förmåga som helst kan vara 'tillåten' av systemet om den inte uttryckligen är markerad som 'SHALL NOT'. Några objekt är markerade som MAY i implementationsguiden för att belysa deras potentiella relevans för användningsfallet.</p></blockquote><h3 id=\"shallIGs\">SKA stödja följande implementationsguider</h3><ul><li><a href=\"index.html\">https://fhir.inera.se/ig/engagementindex/ImplementationGuide/inera.ei.engagementindex</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful-förmågor</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div><p>Alla läs-, skriv-, prenumerations- och exportanrop går genom samma centrala kontroll av behörighet, spärr och loggning. Se sidan Spärr, loggning och behörighet.</p>\n</div><div class=\"lead\"><em>Security</em></div><blockquote><div><p>Se sidan Spärr, loggning och behörighet.</p>\n</div></blockquote><div class=\"lead\"><em>Sammanfattning av systemövergripande interaktioner</em></div><ul><li><strong>SHALL </strong>stöd <code>transaction</code>interaktion beskrivs enligt följande:<div><p>Producenter registrerar och avregistrerar flera poster i en transaction-Bundle. Den registreras helt eller inte alls.</p>\n</div></li></ul></div></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Förmågor per resurs/profil</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Sammanfattning</h4><p>Sammanfattningstabellen listar resurserna som ingår i denna konfiguration, och för varje resurs listar den:</p><ul><li>De relevanta profilerna (om några)</li><li>Interaktionerna som stöds av varje resurs (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>yp är endast närvarande om minst en av resurserna har stöd för dem.</li><li><span>De obligatoriska, rekommenderade och vissa valfria sökparametrarna (om några). </span></li><li>De länkade resurserna aktiverade för <code>_include</code></li><li>De övriga resurserna aktiverade för <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>Operationerna på resursen (om några)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resurstyp</b></th><th><b>Profil</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET en resurs (läs-interaktion)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET tidigare versioner av resurser (vread-interaktion)\">V-R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET alla resurser av typen (sök-interaktion)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT en ny resursversion (uppdatera-interaktion)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST en ny resurs (skapa-interaktion)\">C</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"DELETE en resurs (radera-interaktion)\">D</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET ändringar för en resurs (historik-interaktion på instans)\">H-I</b></th><th><b title=\"Obligatoriska och rekommenderade sökparametrar\">Sökningar</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operationer</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#DocumentReference1-1\">DocumentReference</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-IneraIndexEntry.html\">https://fhir.inera.se/ig/engagementindex/StructureDefinition/IneraIndexEntry</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td>patient, type, status, custodian, identifier, format-code, format-canonical, content-last-updated, source-endpoint, _lastUpdated</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Subscription1-2\">Subscription</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-IneraIndexSubscription.html\">https://fhir.inera.se/ig/engagementindex/StructureDefinition/IneraIndexSubscription</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td/><td/><td/><td><code>$status</code>, <code>$events</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#SubscriptionTopic1-3\">SubscriptionTopic</a></td><td>\u00a0</td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"DocumentReference1-1\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>DocumentReference</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Bassystemprofil</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-IneraIndexEntry.html\">Indexpost (FHIR-EI)</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profilkonformans</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul><li><strong>SHALL</strong> stöd <code>read</code>, <code>vread</code>, <code>history-instance</code>, <code>search-type</code><br/><code>update</code><div><p>Villkorad uppdatering på identifier: PUT DocumentReference?identifier=system|value.</p>\n</div></li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Dokumentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Indexposter. En producent får bara skapa, uppdatera och avregistrera poster som tillhör dess registrerade identitet. Avregistrering sker med villkorad uppdatering, aldrig med delete. En sökning utan status-parameter returnerar bara poster med status current.</p>\n</div></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Sökparametrar</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Konformans</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Typ</th><th>Dokumentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/documentreference.html#search\">patient</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Med modifieraren :identifier, t.ex. patient:identifier=http://electronichealth.se/identifier/personnummer|191212121212.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/documentreference.html#search\">type</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/documentreference.html#search\">status</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Standardvärde current. Avregistrerade poster returneras bara när status anges explicit.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/documentreference.html#search\">custodian</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Vårdgivare, med modifieraren :identifier och HSA-id.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/documentreference.html#search\">identifier</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/documentreference.html#search\">format-code</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Informationsmängd som kategori (content.profile som Coding).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/documentreference.html#search\">format-canonical</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Informationsmängd som profil-canonical (content.profile som canonical).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"SearchParameter-DocumentReference-content-last-updated.html\">content-last-updated</a></td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"SearchParameter-DocumentReference-source-endpoint.html\">source-endpoint</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/resource.html#search\">_lastUpdated</a></td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div><p>Inkrementell avstämning, tillsammans med status=current,superseded,entered-in-error.</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\">\u00a0</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Subscription1-2\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>Subscription</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Bassystemprofil</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-IneraIndexSubscription.html\">Prenumeration på indexposter (FHIR-EI)</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profilkonformans</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul><li><strong>SHALL</strong> stöd <code>create</code>, <code>read</code>, <code>update</code>, <code>delete</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Dokumentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Topic-baserade prenumerationer på topic indexpost-andrad. Notiser filtreras på samma sätt som sökningar.</p>\n</div></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Utökade operationer</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Konformans</th><th>Operation</th><th>Dokumentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>$status</td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>$events</td><td><div/></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"SubscriptionTopic1-3\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>SubscriptionTopic</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">FHIR-kärnresurs</span><br/><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/subscriptiontopic.html\">SubscriptionTopic</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul><li><strong>SHALL</strong> stöd <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Dokumentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Servern exponerar topic indexpost-andrad.</p>\n</div></blockquote></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
